WEBVTT

00:02.711 --> 00:03.712
BASEMENT LEVEL FIVE

00:03.795 --> 00:06.005
You keep dodging my attacks. How pathetic.

00:06.089 --> 00:07.966
Just let me kill you already.

00:08.508 --> 00:11.344
This place means a lot
to someone on my team.

00:11.428 --> 00:12.846
Just leave already.

00:13.388 --> 00:16.641
We are looking at the big picture.

00:17.267 --> 00:20.437
We took over this lab
for the future of the hit man industry.

00:20.520 --> 00:22.647
We are the bringers of light.

00:23.189 --> 00:27.819
You and your team and whatnot
are unimportant, trivial details.

00:28.486 --> 00:30.030
Say what you want,

00:30.739 --> 00:35.326
but if you can't care for the people
close to you, you won't get anywhere.

00:35.410 --> 00:37.412
You think you're so wise?

00:38.371 --> 00:40.290
I bet your precious teammates

00:40.373 --> 00:43.960
are being slaughtered
by my subordinates as we speak.

00:47.756 --> 00:48.840
I'm not worried.

00:56.431 --> 01:00.268
My employees aren't as helpless
as you seem to think.

01:01.061 --> 01:05.273
I hate people who talk back to me

01:05.356 --> 01:08.902
almost as much as I hate Christmas,

01:09.527 --> 01:11.154
Taro Sakamoto.

01:11.863 --> 01:16.159
I hate people like you too...
People who talk too much.

01:19.579 --> 01:20.622
Damn it!

01:20.705 --> 01:23.124
They've figured out we escaped.

01:23.208 --> 01:27.837
So... I guess I'll be taking off now--

01:27.921 --> 01:29.547
We're holding you hostage!

01:32.550 --> 01:35.970
<i>I'm gonna get out of here
and apologize to Shin no matter what!</i>

01:39.474 --> 01:42.602
Perfect timing, Heisuke!

01:42.685 --> 01:44.479
Perfect timing?

01:45.522 --> 01:47.607
PERFECT TIMING = HERO = AWESOME
PIISUKE

01:47.690 --> 01:50.360
Your mind really sucks to read!

03:23.202 --> 03:26.164
ALL ABOARD

03:26.247 --> 03:29.417
<i>A sniper who wants to stand out?
That's a first.</i>

03:30.043 --> 03:32.545
<i>Not much of a threat
if I know where he is.</i>

03:33.838 --> 03:36.049
You sure that's where you wanna be?

03:41.971 --> 03:45.058
The rebound rounds!
That's our first-class sniper.

03:46.351 --> 03:50.688
From my point of view,
it's like you're right in front of me.

03:54.108 --> 03:55.401
He went invisible again!

03:57.862 --> 04:00.406
You can hide, but I can still hear you.

04:00.490 --> 04:01.741
Gotcha.

04:06.412 --> 04:07.247
Where'd he go?

04:08.623 --> 04:09.999
I can't hear him.

04:15.213 --> 04:16.047
Up there!

04:17.006 --> 04:18.341
What's he doing?

04:18.424 --> 04:21.219
I can see him clear as day.
What an easy target.

04:35.275 --> 04:37.402
Did you think I had a superpower?

04:38.027 --> 04:41.698
This suit can make
anything inside it invisible.

04:42.407 --> 04:43.241
Now,

04:44.367 --> 04:45.994
let's take care of you.

04:52.625 --> 04:54.419
Darn, another ricochet.

04:55.211 --> 04:57.046
You tore off my arm.

04:57.547 --> 05:01.342
Give in now or your head'll be next.

05:03.469 --> 05:05.013
Run, Heisuke!

05:05.555 --> 05:06.556
Just kidding.

05:06.639 --> 05:07.557
<i>He hid one arm?</i>

05:10.226 --> 05:11.644
Heisuke!

05:19.569 --> 05:21.612
I really don't get it.

05:21.696 --> 05:25.074
Why do all this for other people?

05:25.575 --> 05:28.453
Why not cut them off
when they become a nuisance?

05:29.037 --> 05:31.247
Go home, you third-class hit man.

05:31.873 --> 05:32.957
Stop right there.

05:33.916 --> 05:35.460
You know what my team says?

05:36.127 --> 05:39.839
They say I'm a first-class sniper.

05:40.465 --> 05:41.632
And you know what?

05:42.925 --> 05:47.388
I sure as hell
won't let you call them liars!

05:47.930 --> 05:49.891
What a drag.

05:50.975 --> 05:52.060
Just die, then.

05:52.143 --> 05:53.436
Shin!

06:08.367 --> 06:09.702
You missed.

06:10.369 --> 06:13.414
Not bad for a shot in the dark, I guess...

06:17.502 --> 06:18.795
What did you...

06:20.755 --> 06:22.381
You're up,

06:22.465 --> 06:23.424
Shin.

06:24.550 --> 06:26.636
<i>Damn it, the water...</i>

06:32.141 --> 06:34.769
You're no threat if I can see you!

06:38.731 --> 06:40.274
<i>My body's aching.</i>

06:41.859 --> 06:42.944
<i>I'm so tired...</i>

06:44.153 --> 06:45.780
LEADER, SEBA
THROWING IN THE TOWEL

06:46.405 --> 06:47.657
Great job.

06:47.740 --> 06:50.576
You read my mind perfectly.

06:50.827 --> 06:51.744
SHOOT SPRINKLER

06:51.828 --> 06:53.621
SEE INVISIBLE GUY
GET HIM

06:53.704 --> 06:57.291
I could barely understand what you meant!

06:57.375 --> 06:58.209
Really?

07:04.590 --> 07:06.300
I see it has begun.

07:07.176 --> 07:09.804
In the unlikely event that we are exposed,

07:09.887 --> 07:12.849
we set up a system
that would blow up the whole lab

07:12.932 --> 07:14.809
and any proof into smithereens.

07:15.393 --> 07:19.230
It's a shame to waste so much progress,
but it is what it is.

07:19.856 --> 07:23.067
In approximately 20 minutes,
the Lab will be destroyed.

07:23.693 --> 07:24.986
And so will your team.

07:25.069 --> 07:26.237
Twenty minutes?

07:31.492 --> 07:32.952
Five is all I need.

07:41.127 --> 07:43.463
That body hinders your movements.

07:44.088 --> 07:46.007
A stark contrast to mine, no?

07:46.090 --> 07:49.969
Don't you think this body of mine
is magnificent?

07:50.052 --> 07:52.472
With the Lab's science and technology,

07:52.555 --> 07:56.893
I've outfitted 70% of my body
with weaponry.

07:57.518 --> 08:01.481
You're practically a sitting duck to me.
Or rather, a sitting <i>pig.</i>

08:02.064 --> 08:03.691
I have my own weapons.

08:05.568 --> 08:08.946
<i>What?</i> Now <i>he's going to use weapons?</i>

08:09.530 --> 08:11.491
<i>He wanted to evaluate me first...</i>

08:13.576 --> 08:14.660
50% OFF STICKER
FLYER

08:14.744 --> 08:15.661
MECHANICAL PENCIL

08:15.745 --> 08:18.372
Cute little "friends" you've got there!

08:26.297 --> 08:28.758
What good do you think that junk will--

08:31.719 --> 08:35.640
Flicking lead at me? That's bad manners.

08:35.723 --> 08:38.518
But one eye is enough to fight you.

08:39.268 --> 08:40.228
50% OFF MARKED PRICE

08:40.311 --> 08:42.647
What did you do to me? I can't see.

08:45.858 --> 08:49.278
Relying on your weapons
is proof that you're third-class.

08:52.114 --> 08:54.408
If you can't defeat a third-class hit man,

08:54.492 --> 08:57.286
that would make you fifth-class at best.

08:58.246 --> 09:00.414
Are you immortal?

09:00.498 --> 09:01.666
What do you think?

09:02.166 --> 09:05.545
What would you need to do to kill me?

09:05.628 --> 09:07.171
Even I don't know.

09:15.972 --> 09:18.849
Only <i>he</i> gave me the affirmation
I had longed for.

09:19.433 --> 09:21.602
All of this is for <i>him.</i>

09:22.186 --> 09:23.354
I...

09:38.953 --> 09:43.374
You're just another hypocrite
that refuses to dirty his own hands.

09:49.046 --> 09:50.381
How amusing!

09:51.007 --> 09:53.426
Let's see how long you last.

09:54.719 --> 09:56.137
CUSTOMER APPRECIATION SALE!

09:57.722 --> 09:59.432
You really talk too much.

10:03.185 --> 10:06.063
<i>The next station is Okutabi.</i>

10:06.147 --> 10:07.940
<i>The doors on the right side will open.</i>

10:10.318 --> 10:13.362
<i>I'm so bored of doing the same old
routine work day in and day out.</i>

10:13.446 --> 10:16.198
<i>If only something exciting
would happen for once.</i>

10:32.089 --> 10:34.383
<i>- The subway?</i>
- Are you okay?

10:34.467 --> 10:37.011
<i>I see, it's connected
to the underground tunnel.</i>

10:37.094 --> 10:38.095
Excuse me.

10:39.930 --> 10:42.725
He must be really thirsty.

10:47.313 --> 10:48.689
<i>Magnificent.</i>

10:48.773 --> 10:51.984
<i>Sakamoto... I see why he's</i> his <i>favorite.</i>

10:52.610 --> 10:56.489
<i>He cleverly utilizes his surroundings
as he fights,</i>

10:56.572 --> 10:59.283
<i>making his existence itself
an invincible weapon.</i>

10:59.367 --> 11:02.912
<i>He is, indeed, the ultimate hit man.</i>

11:04.622 --> 11:06.582
Where is he hiding?

11:10.461 --> 11:11.921
<i>He's so fast.</i>

11:14.757 --> 11:18.260
If you are immortal,
I don't need to worry about killing you.

11:25.476 --> 11:28.020
How could he be so violent?

11:28.562 --> 11:31.565
I know they were messing with a stray cat,
but this is too far...

11:32.400 --> 11:37.196
<i>Why am I being shunned?
What's so wrong about erasing bad people?</i>

11:37.279 --> 11:38.280
I'm scared.

11:38.364 --> 11:40.199
Somebody call the police!

11:41.200 --> 11:44.787
<i>Everything I do is for the public good,</i>

11:44.870 --> 11:46.789
<i>but no one understands me.</i>

12:02.513 --> 12:05.391
You are such a good person.

12:06.350 --> 12:07.685
Few can do what you do.

12:07.768 --> 12:11.897
You dirty your own hands
for the sake of others.

12:12.773 --> 12:16.986
Noble justice calls for evil.

12:18.779 --> 12:23.367
But everyone around me calls me a creep...

12:27.204 --> 12:29.081
You're on this side, aren't you?

12:30.749 --> 12:34.128
I'll accept you. The whole you.

12:37.965 --> 12:40.718
<i>Will you fight with me?</i>

12:43.345 --> 12:46.140
For noble justice...

12:46.849 --> 12:48.392
<i>Okutabi. Okutabi.</i>

12:48.476 --> 12:51.812
I want to see that <i>his</i> dream comes true.

12:52.354 --> 12:55.774
Anyone who gets in the way
will be eliminated.

12:57.151 --> 12:59.820
You're in the priority seat. Get up.

13:00.571 --> 13:01.405
There you go.

13:01.906 --> 13:04.617
Thank you, dear.

13:06.660 --> 13:10.623
<i>How can this be?
My body can't keep up with him.</i>

13:23.385 --> 13:28.307
<i>The next station is Satohigure.
The doors on the left side will open.</i>

13:28.390 --> 13:30.601
<i>Please mind the gap
as you get off the train.</i>

13:30.684 --> 13:32.019
Whoa, what was that?!

13:33.145 --> 13:36.524
<i>What is this impervious power?</i>

13:36.607 --> 13:40.277
<i>He's just a normal human, and yet...</i>

13:40.861 --> 13:41.820
Damn you!

14:11.433 --> 14:15.771
<i>It's over. I finally defeated that devil.</i>

14:25.489 --> 14:28.909
I bet <i>he</i> will be pleased with me for this.

14:28.993 --> 14:33.455
That's right. I should get new clothes
before the next time we meet.

14:46.427 --> 14:48.888
Stay back! Get away from me!

14:48.971 --> 14:52.433
Why won't you die?

14:52.516 --> 14:55.603
You're just some low-class nobody
with no dreams or ideals!

14:55.686 --> 14:59.690
We are the ones that society needs!

15:00.399 --> 15:01.400
Thank you.

15:02.943 --> 15:04.278
Say what you want,

15:06.322 --> 15:10.701
but I wouldn't want someone like you
anywhere near my family.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.432
<i>Mr. Sakamoto, are you all right?</i>

15:33.515 --> 15:34.767
I took care of the boss.

15:34.850 --> 15:36.769
<i>-Really? Thanks!</i>
- And Lu?

15:36.852 --> 15:41.190
<i>I'm heading to the fourth level
of the basement, but the Lab seems to be--</i>

15:41.273 --> 15:44.109
<i>- Junk collection.</i>
- The Lab is set to self-destruct.

15:44.193 --> 15:46.028
It'll collapse in about 15 minutes.

15:46.111 --> 15:46.946
Thanks, sir!

15:47.780 --> 15:48.656
Hurry.

15:53.953 --> 15:57.665
What on earth is going on?
The place is falling apart.

15:57.748 --> 16:00.125
An earthquake wouldn't do this.

16:01.001 --> 16:02.378
I don't wanna die!

16:02.962 --> 16:04.129
We have to find the exit.

16:10.135 --> 16:11.387
Shin!

16:12.680 --> 16:14.348
Nice, you found each other!

16:16.725 --> 16:17.810
What's with you two?

16:20.020 --> 16:21.146
Let's get out of here.

16:23.941 --> 16:27.194
Shin, I'm so sorry
I said those mean things to you!

16:27.277 --> 16:29.363
It was all my fault.

16:29.446 --> 16:33.242
This all happened
because I kept using your apron.

16:33.325 --> 16:34.827
Don't get your snot on me!

16:36.829 --> 16:38.580
I'm not upset anyway.

16:39.415 --> 16:40.290
And I guess,

16:40.374 --> 16:41.208
you know,

16:42.209 --> 16:43.919
I was harsh too, so...

16:44.878 --> 16:45.796
Sorry about that.

16:48.132 --> 16:53.053
I have no idea what this is all about,
but aren't happy endings great, Piisuke?

16:54.138 --> 16:55.139
Shin.

16:56.140 --> 16:56.974
Old man?

16:58.600 --> 16:59.435
Hey...

17:00.144 --> 17:00.978
Hi.

17:01.603 --> 17:02.938
It's been a while.

17:03.522 --> 17:04.398
Yeah...

17:11.196 --> 17:13.323
We got less than ten minutes
till the Lab caves in!

17:14.158 --> 17:17.369
Oh, man!
How are we gonna get everyone out?

17:17.453 --> 17:19.329
There must be a ton more people in here.

17:19.413 --> 17:21.498
Old man, got a floor plan of the Lab?

17:21.582 --> 17:22.541
What? Sure.

17:24.793 --> 17:26.378
It's something like this.

17:26.462 --> 17:28.881
What do we do? We're running out of time!

17:31.592 --> 17:33.469
<i>What's going on?</i>

17:33.552 --> 17:35.220
<i>I'm scared... Somebody help!</i>

17:35.304 --> 17:36.555
<i>Help us!</i>

17:37.848 --> 17:39.224
Lu, Heisuke,

17:40.142 --> 17:42.269
I can still hear people on this floor.

17:42.352 --> 17:43.687
- Can you get them?
- On it!

17:43.771 --> 17:45.397
We'll meet up later!

17:46.523 --> 17:48.233
You come downstairs with me.

17:48.317 --> 17:49.777
Right!

17:51.904 --> 17:52.738
<i>Shin...</i>

17:53.447 --> 17:55.699
<i>He's using his skills to their fullest.</i>

17:56.325 --> 17:59.912
Your research turned out
to be pretty useful, didn't it?

18:01.246 --> 18:02.998
Shin, you...

18:08.962 --> 18:09.963
Yeah.

18:10.964 --> 18:12.049
You're right.

18:20.390 --> 18:24.770
Mr. Shishiba, are you done yet?
My arm's sore from cutting through rubble.

18:25.270 --> 18:27.856
I believe in you, Osaragi.

18:30.317 --> 18:31.235
Bingo.

18:32.236 --> 18:35.155
Just as we thought.
He's the mastermind behind this.

18:36.615 --> 18:37.616
Slur.

18:38.283 --> 18:40.536
We've finally got a lead on you.

18:41.203 --> 18:43.330
Come on, look this way.

18:44.123 --> 18:45.874
Rats, couldn't see his face.

18:46.416 --> 18:47.709
Useless.

18:49.169 --> 18:52.172
That's the JAA's enemy?

18:54.174 --> 18:55.217
He must be strong.

18:57.594 --> 18:59.471
No matter.

18:59.555 --> 19:02.432
They've gone and started a fight
with The Order.

19:02.516 --> 19:05.519
We kill 'em all.

19:06.812 --> 19:08.522
Shin, which way?

19:10.315 --> 19:12.234
Two ahead of us,

19:12.901 --> 19:14.945
and I hear another one over there!

19:15.028 --> 19:16.655
You go get them.

19:16.738 --> 19:17.614
Got it.

19:24.329 --> 19:25.330
I see someone!

19:39.052 --> 19:41.763
<i>What was that threat I just felt?</i>

19:50.063 --> 19:52.232
So you're Shin.

19:53.650 --> 19:55.611
Say hi to Sakamoto for me.

20:03.702 --> 20:06.288
Who... What...

20:07.372 --> 20:08.582
We made it!

20:08.665 --> 20:10.042
We're free.

20:10.125 --> 20:11.293
Thank God we're alive.

20:11.376 --> 20:14.296
Hey, Mr. Manager. There he is!

20:14.379 --> 20:16.131
Lu! Mr. Sakamoto!

20:16.215 --> 20:17.299
Shin, are you okay?

20:17.382 --> 20:18.342
Director!

20:18.425 --> 20:19.468
Are you hurt?

20:19.551 --> 20:21.428
What about you guys?

20:22.137 --> 20:23.597
I mean, the whole Lab's gone.

20:24.306 --> 20:25.974
Don't worry about us.

20:26.475 --> 20:29.603
All our research data
is stored right here.

20:30.187 --> 20:31.021
Right.

20:31.647 --> 20:33.106
<i>- He's okay!
- Thank goodness.</i>

20:33.190 --> 20:34.358
<i>Thank you.</i>

20:34.441 --> 20:35.609
<i>He's still a shorty.</i>

20:35.692 --> 20:37.736
<i>He grew up into a handsome guy.</i>

20:38.612 --> 20:41.323
Hey! I can hear
everything you're thinking, you know!

20:41.406 --> 20:42.491
<i>Yeah, still short.</i>

20:42.574 --> 20:44.534
Oh, shut up!

20:46.954 --> 20:47.788
Hi there.

20:48.288 --> 20:51.041
You must be from Sakamoto's.

20:51.124 --> 20:54.294
It was a real relief for me
to see how happy Shin looks.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.297
Take good care of him, please.

20:57.381 --> 20:59.216
Of course, old man!

20:59.299 --> 21:00.133
Sure!

21:03.053 --> 21:05.013
SAKAMOTO'S

21:05.097 --> 21:05.931
My gosh!

21:06.014 --> 21:08.600
Look at the state of you! What happened?

21:08.684 --> 21:11.853
Well, a lot went on at the museum.

21:11.937 --> 21:14.439
Make sure to put your clothes in the wash.

21:14.940 --> 21:17.859
Daddy, did you see?
At Bring Your Parents to School Day?

21:17.943 --> 21:20.487
I went up and wrote the answer
on the blackboard!

21:20.570 --> 21:22.823
You finally got to talk about it,
huh, Hana?

21:22.906 --> 21:25.575
- Yeah!
- Lu, I'll take that if you're sleeping.

21:27.911 --> 21:29.830
Hey, I was saving the best for last!

21:29.913 --> 21:32.416
Come on, don't be so petty.

21:32.916 --> 21:34.584
Fine, I'll take this instead.

21:34.668 --> 21:36.837
Hey! My konjac <i>chikuwa</i> jelly!

21:36.920 --> 21:38.463
Now we're even.

21:38.547 --> 21:40.841
They're not even close to the same value!

21:40.924 --> 21:44.386
If we're comparing value,
my fried prawn is obviously better.

21:44.886 --> 21:46.179
You're such a child.

21:46.263 --> 21:48.056
You'd better can it or I'll--

21:49.850 --> 21:52.144
Why did you kill us in your mind?!

21:52.894 --> 21:54.479
<i>You two never learn.</i>

23:20.857 --> 23:25.862
Subtitle translation by: Yuka Kristi
